    <title>Over-Smoothing in Deep Graph Neural Networks: A Spectral Analysis</title>
    <summary>  Node representations in deep graph neural networks become similar as
layers are added. We explain this over-smoothing through the spectrum of the
propagation operator and propose a normalisation that slows it down.
</summary>
